# Example ReRDMFT input file: stretched LiH (5 Angstrom), 6-31G, GNOF, FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE with
# ORBITAL_OPTIMIZER NEO -- the NEO counterpart of lih_c4_gnof_full_optimization_dissociated.inp
# (X2C and C4_SPINOR in one run, C4_SPINOR rotations restricted to the positive-energy spinors).
# This near-degenerate geometry is a hard case for a second-order method, but with the Hessian-diagonal
# preconditioner NEO converges here in about a minute, to the same energy as ADAM (see
# lih_X2C_gnof_full_optimization_dissociated.inp).
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
X2C TRUE
C4_SPINOR TRUE
FUNCTIONAL GNOF
PNOF_SUBSPACES 2
PNOF_COUPLING 2
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE
ORBITAL_OPTIMIZER NEO
MACRO_ENERGY_TOLERANCE 1e-10
DIIS FALSE

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   5.000000
END
